            "review_text": "A L\nStratford-upon-Avon, United Kingdom510 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Indian cuisine\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nThis is a restaurant that is a bit out of the way but well worth going to if you enjoy authentic Indian cuisine. We had a pakora stater and it was delicious and plentiful. The mains a keema and vegetable main were spot on in taste and heat. The service was attentive and subtle. Not the busiest restaurant that we visited but somewhere we will definitely go again.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2025",
